  "description": "Two dozen fungal genera with named hosts in FungalTraits: parasites of insects, of other fungi and of people, the cultivated fungus of termite mounds, smuts and ergots of grasses, and moulds that live on other moulds. Tzeanania lives in Ophiocordyceps, which lives in insects.",
